1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,479
I'm sorry, officer.

2
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,640
I promise he won't do it again.

3
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,080
Good thing he didn't get physical.

4
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,800
Otherwise, this would be a serious matter.

5
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,860
Yes, I understand.

6
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,860
But his behavior was still wrong.

7
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,660
You should apologize to them.

8
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Both parties need to sign a public security mediation agreement.

9
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,200
What? I have to apologize to a deadbeat?

10
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:54,640
An apology is not enough.

11
00:01:55,479 --> 00:01:57,640
Look at how badly my son is hurt.

12
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:59,640
No, we have to sue them.

13
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,800
We have to sue. We must sue.

14
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,520
We must make him compensate us for emotional distress.

15
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,920
As for Zhang Guang's matter, I think...

16
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:07,880
No problem.

17
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,639
The police won't file a case,

18
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:11,320
but you two can file a private prosecution.

19
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:12,840
Besides the basic litigation fees,

20
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,920
there are attorney fees.

21
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:14,600
The extra cost

22
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,000
is the psychiatric evaluation fee.

23
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,920
Do the evaluation. We must do it.

24
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,120
Just do it.

25
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,280
How much can an evaluation cost?

26
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,200
About 100,000 yuan should be enough.

27
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,079
That much?

28
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,600
This...

29
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,079
Well...

30
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,000
Then we...

31
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,260
Actually, an apology is fine too.

32
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,320
An apology is fine.

33
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:33,240
Louder.

34
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:36,570
Where's the energy you had when you pulled out the shoehorn?

35
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,040
I'm sorry.

36
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,920
How was it? Did you enjoy the show?

37
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:44,680
It was interesting. I didn't come for nothing.

38
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,560
Remember to pay next time.

39
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,180
I'll pay you right now.

40
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,120
Here.

41
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:53,280
Your senior partner, little tiger.

42
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:57,930
I'm leaving.

43
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,840
What are you doing? Slamming things around.

44
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:15,240
Come on, hand over all your business cards.

45
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,700
Then explain it to me, come on.

46
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,560
Who appointed you as a senior partner?

47
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,400
This title?

48
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,640
In hair salons,

49
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:26,680
they have senior Tonys.

50
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,680
Isn't it just a title?

51
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,680
To ask for a higher price.

52
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,560
Is that the same thing?

53
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,480
Do you know that

54
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:34,920
if they investigate, my law firm will have to close down?

55
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:36,640
It won't go that far.

56
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,120
Also,

57
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,930
who gave you the bad idea to block Zhang Guang?

58
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:41,800
When you do this kind of thing,

59
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,560
can you discuss it with me a little?

60
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,840
Stop nagging, okay?

61
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,680
Didn't I just want to help Aunt Fang

62
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,680
get her money back quickly?

63
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:50,480
I thought you were worried about your commission.

64
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,840
Yes, I am worried about my commission.

65
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,240
Is there a problem with that?

66
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,400
Wasn't it because your method didn't work

67
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,680
that I used some tactics?

68
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,560
What tactics?

69
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,400
Your tactics are

70
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,960
pushing the boundaries of the law, right?

71
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,800
No, it won't cause any trouble.

72
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,960
Okay, I also think it won't.

73
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,300
Then let's do this.

74
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,380
Don't get involved in this case anymore.

75
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,240
Why?

76
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,280
Why shouldn't I get involved?

77
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,280
I brought this case in.

78
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,079
Okay then, let's share the risk.

79
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,680
You owe a share of the legal fees I advanced.

80
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,800
Didn't you say I didn't need to?

81
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,959
Are you going back on your word now?

82
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:22,240
Yes, I'm going back on my word. So what?

83
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,080
No, you...

84
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:27,000
Okay, fine.

85
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,240
Just you wait. Fine.

86
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,000
I'm waiting.

87
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:40,440
Xiaolong.

88
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,400
Dad.

89
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:43,420
Uncle Li, you're here too.

90
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,560
Just took the car out for a spin,

91
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,960
took him for a ride on the way,

92
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:49,360
and then I'll pick you up to go home tonight.

93
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,080
Car?

94
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,840
Who did you steal the car from this time?

95
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,840
What do you mean steal?

96
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,120
It's all legal.

97
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,400
Look at how smug he is.

98
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,800
Uncle Ermao at the second-hand market

99
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,000
found him a job.

100
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,120
Doing sales, right?

101
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,400
No,

102
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,400
why do you always swallow words when you speak?

103
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,260
Swallow words?

104
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,560
Sales manager.

105
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,680
My dad is Manager Xiao now.

106
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:11,080
He should be smug. He'll be smug for a while, right?

107
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,120
Well, you stay here.

108
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,560
Show him around,

109
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,960
and I'll go down to inspect.

110
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:15,800
Where are you going to inspect?

111
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,000
Don't scratch the car.

112
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,000
No, impossible.

113
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:19,840
Xiaolong.

114
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,840
I have to say, you've set this up really well.

115
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:25,000
Small as it is, it has everything.

116
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:25,520
Yes.

117
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:28,120
I feel a strong sense of righteousness.

118
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,560
Do you know why, Dad Li?

119
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,840
Because of this Sword of Justice.

120
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:33,360
The Sword of Justice you wrote.

121
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,890
I'm in the center position.

122
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,120
Hey, kid.

123
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,800
When you're done wiping,

124
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,680
help me wipe this car too.

125
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:53,240
Didn't you go undercover

126
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,680
for that case before?

127
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,800
Why are you still here?

128
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,800
Where else would I be?

129
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,130
This bathhouse is mine.

130
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,450
This is your bathhouse?

131
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,240
Look at you.

132
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:06,160
You even have a business.

133
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,720
A small business.

134
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,130
Then why do you keep running upstairs?

135
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,800
Wait, isn't your case over yet?

136
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,800
Yes, the case is over,

137
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,920
but I'm not done with her.

138
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:16,800
What?

139
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,720
Didn't you say there's nothing between you two?

140
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,920
It's not what you think.

141
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,120
What do I think?

142
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,560
Let me tell you,

143
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,240
no matter what,

144
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:26,240
if you two keep hanging out like this,

145
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:26,920
over time,

146
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,240
what if...

147
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,720
You're not trying to say we'll fall in love over time, are you?

148
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,920
See, you said it yourself.

149
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:30,800
What do you mean I said it myself?

150
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,260
You were leading me there.

151
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,800
Jun, don't worry.

152
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:38,240
Whether it's our values or our looks,

153
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,560
we're incompatible in every way.

154
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,000
We can't possibly fall in love.

155
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,560
Growing maggots is more likely.

156
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,560
If you're a man, swear on it.

157
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,360
Fine, I'll swear.

158
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,360
Jun, watch me.

159
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,560
If we ever get together,

160
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,360
may my guts rot and my feet fester.

161
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,600
May I never make money in this life,

162
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,860
and be a dog in the next.

163
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,159
See?

164
00:06:54,159 --> 00:06:55,820
I resonate with you, you know?

165
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:58,159
Okay, remember this from now on.

166
00:06:58,159 --> 00:07:00,280
You can't even make eye contact with my daughter,

167
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,120
let alone spark anything.

168
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,000
Spark what?

169
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:02,480
Impossible.

170
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,720
Sparks are the biggest taboo in a bathhouse.

171
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,840
Can I wash your car now?

172
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:06,640
Let me wash it.

173
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:07,850
I'll wash it for you.

174
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,360
This car is too old.

175
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:10,480
What do you mean?

176
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,840
It's an old car,

177
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:13,100
so it matches an old...

178
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,120
an old hero.

179
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,240
You weren't trying to say 'old geezer', were you?

180
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:16,920
No, no.

181
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,100
Old headlights. Old headlights.

182
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:20,920
Right here.

183
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,400
Sir, who are you looking for?

184
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,130
That's him. That's him.

185
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,360
Sir, you can't go in.

186
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,000
I'm looking for someone. I'm looking for someone, sir.

187
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:31,720
Wang Ruoqi.

188
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,280
Where is Wang Ruoqi?

189
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:35,800
Come out, Wang Ruoqi!

190
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,260
Sir, sir, let's calm down.

191
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:37,600
Don't touch me.

192
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,480
Can I help you?

193
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,840
Look, what are you doing?

194
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:40,680
It's broken.

195
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,360
Lawyers,

196
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:46,040
Wang Ruoqi introduced me to a crappy house.

197
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,800
The bathroom leaked and wasn't fixed.

198
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,840
I fell and broke my arm.

199
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:49,920
A comminuted fracture.

200
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,360
The house I lent you

201
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,480
was well-maintained.

202
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,140
There shouldn't be any leaks.

203
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,400
Are you trying to extort me?

204
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,680
Extort? You think I'm extorting her?

205
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,680
If your house was fine,

206
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,720
would my husband's arm be like this?

207
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,240
That's not what I meant.

208
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,360
Didn't you say

209
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,040
this house belongs to your friend, right?

210
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,920
My friend's.

211
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,280
Liar. Look.

212
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,010
I brought the evidence.

213
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,280
It's written in black and white on this contract.

214
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:09,720
The landlord is Wang Binghui.

215
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:10,160
Look.

216
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,240
Who is Wang Binghui? Is he your father?

217
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,400
Don't go too far.

218
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,360
I kindly helped you.

219
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,600
Why are you biting the hand that feeds you?

220
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,400
I told you.

221
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:17,480
Wang Binghui is her father.

222
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,240
They teamed up to trick us.

223
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,600
Cut the crap.

224
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,400
You must compensate me,

225
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,680
or I'll sue you in court.

226
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,600
I'll sue your whole family.

227
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,360
Isn't it just Wang Binghui?

228
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,480
Don't get physical. Don't get physical.

229
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,360
Is there anyone in charge?

230
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,360
Mr. Ma, Mrs. Ma.

231
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,280
Attorney Li, you're just in time.

232
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:29,720
Can you solve this?

233
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,040
Such a severe injury?

234
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,039
Are you in charge?

235
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:32,720
Yes, yes.

236
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,000
Lanya, Meeting Room 1.

237
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,400
Okay.

238
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,010
Please calm down first.

239
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:42,679
You can tell me your demands.

240
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:44,210
I'll figure something out.

241
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:45,920
Mr. Li.

242
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:49,120
My husband and I are not unreasonable people.

243
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,720
But look at my husband's arm.

244
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,720
He's so badly injured.

245
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:55,480
For lost wages, medical bills,

246
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,720
and emotional distress,

247
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:58,400
you have to give us some compensation.

248
00:08:58,400 --> 00:08:59,240
No problem.

249
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:02,000
How much do you want?

250
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:06,400
At least 500,000.

251
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:12,040
For an intern lawyer,

252
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,640
isn't 500,000 a bit too much?

253
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,140
Is this price negotiable?

254
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:18,240
Mr. Li, doesn't she have a house?

255
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,240
If she can't afford it,

256
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,720
she can just sell the house.

257
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:22,120
The house belongs to her father,

258
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:22,920
not hers.

259
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:23,920
She can't make the decision, right?

260
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:25,680
I don't care if she can make the decision or not.

261
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:27,160
It has nothing to do with us.

262
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,240
If she doesn't pay,

263
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,120
we'll defend our rights and go to court.

264
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,680
We have nothing to lose.

265
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:32,840
Honghu is famous, right?

266
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,700
I'll make you famous nationwide.

267
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,680
500,000.

268
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:36,720
Not a penny less.

269
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,240
Okay, then let's not just make Honghu famous.

270
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,480
Let's get famous together.

271
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:43,360
Mr. Ma, look up and look over there.

272
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:46,240
There are two surveillance cameras in this room.

273
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:48,680
Everything you two just said

274
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:49,920
has been recorded in 360 degrees.

275
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,400
With the purpose of illegal possession,

276
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:53,800
fabricating facts or exaggerating losses,

277
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:54,840
and coercing others to pay

278
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:57,040
obviously unreasonable high compensation.

279
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:57,800
Mr. Ma,

280
00:09:57,920 --> 00:10:00,480
you may be suspected of extortion.

281
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:02,600
Come.

282
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,240
And here are the corporate bills

283
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:07,360
you two provided to the bank.

284
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,600
But combined with your

285
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,480
personal spending records,

286
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,240
I reasonably suspect that you two

287
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:15,480
did not use the bank loan for business operations.

288
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:18,520
You are suspected of loan fraud and embezzlement.

289
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:20,360
Mr. Ma,

290
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,520
at this stage,

291
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,840
let's not bother a legal intern.

292
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:27,360
Hurry up and find yourself a lawyer.

293
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,720
We are at the law firm now,

294
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,720
so it's convenient.

295
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,840
If you have any questions, you can ask Attorney Guo.

296
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:32,480
Okay.

297
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:34,360
No.

298
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,560
Lawyer Li.

299
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,240
Lawyer Li.

300
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:48,240
Did you realize something was wrong with them a long time ago?

301
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:50,600
What? Are you blaming me for not warning you earlier?

302
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:53,060
You did warn me to pay attention to the risks.

303
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:55,970
But I didn't expect them to be this kind of people.

304
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,480
You can never truly know someone.

305
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:59,010
The devil is in the details.

306
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,840
Think about when you met the couple before.

307
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,440
Was there anything unusual?

308
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:07,160
The family is in this situation, but she...

309
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,720
I know, Master.

310
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,840
I told you not to call me Master.

311
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,330
Sister Pang.

312
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,210
You're back.

313
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,240
What?

314
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,120
You saw Lawyer Xiao.

315
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,600
Why didn't you say hello?

316
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:38,240
I didn't see him. Is he here?

317
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,860
Do you have cataracts?

318
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,480
How is your case going?

319
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,840
I'm working on it.

320
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:45,600
I was just about to

321
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,240
have them report to me.

322
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,600
I find that you really

323
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:51,260
can't stand seeing me idle for a moment, can you?

324
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,360
Yes, I am.

325
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:08,720
Okay.

326
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,090
I'll be right there.

327
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:10,960
Okay.

328
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,240
What's wrong, sis?

329
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:12,840
Well,

330
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,360
the neighborhood committee called me

331
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,480
and said the bank sent debt collectors

332
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,840
to kick Aunt Fang and the others out.

333
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,120
I need to go there right away.

334
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,480
Then I'll go with you.

335
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,240
No need.

336
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,480
I'll just go by myself.

337
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,360
Drive safely.

338
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,240
Don't rush.

339
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,360
Get in.

340
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,760
Grandma Fang,

341
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:02,000
What happened? Did they kick you out?

342
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,200
I'll call the police.

343
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,840
We left voluntarily.

344
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:10,600
We owe money. We can't deny it.

345
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,240
Then let's go.

346
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,240
Come with me. Let's go.

347
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,240
Where to?

348
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,600
Stay at my place for a few days. Let's go.

349
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,360
It's fine. It's really fine, Grandma. No.

350
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,000
It's really fine.

351
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:20,840
Lawyer Xiao,

352
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:24,240
I appreciate your kindness.

353
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,600
Even if I die on the street,

354
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,840
I can't die in your house.

355
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,480
Don't say that. Let's go, Grandma.

356
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,000
No.

357
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:31,960
Let's go. Listen to me.

358
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,120
I know a place.

359
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,000
Fifty yuan a day.

360
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,380
I have a friend working there.

361
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:40,000
Yes.

362
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:40,730
Yeah.

363
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:44,980
I'm leaving, brother.

364
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:45,860
Bye, take care.

365
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,360
How is it?

366
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,360
He's asleep.

367
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:04,840
Good.

368
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:07,480
Auntie, the paperwork is all done.

369
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,250
You guys have really helped me so much.

370
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,000
I don't know how to repay you.

371
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,360
Aunt Fang, let's not say such things.

372
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,480
After all this trouble,

373
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:23,120
Grandma will definitely need to rest for a while.

374
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,240
Anyway, if anything happens,

375
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,840
let me know immediately.

376
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:29,700
Thank you, Attorney Xiao.

377
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,240
Thank you, Attorney Dong.

378
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:31,960
Aunt Fang,

379
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:34,240
I have to go back and prepare the materials for the second trial.

380
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,240
Let's close the case as soon as possible.

381
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,360
You should spend more time with Grandma.

382
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,360
Please.

383
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,360
It's my duty.

384
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,360
Well,

385
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,960
thank you for this.

386
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,360
For what?

387
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,600
It's nothing.

388
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:54,360
I'll drive.

389
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,720
Director, the house issue has been settled.

390
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:06,520
They will move out within a week.

391
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:07,920
I'm sorry, Director.

392
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:10,120
I didn't handle this well.

393
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:11,360
I told you before,

394
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:13,000
when you come to Honghu for an internship,

395
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,800
you need to control your temper.

396
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,240
Look at the trouble you caused.

397
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:20,360
Fortunately, Lawyer Li covered for you today.

398
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:24,240
Mr. Li, I'm sorry for the trouble.

399
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,960
Her internship ends here.

400
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:29,300
No need to keep her.

401
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,450
How did it go?

402
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:45,600
Well...

403
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:49,060
If it doesn't work out, the three of us can go talk to him.

404
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:55,120
Director, it's like this.

405
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:56,840
Please don't be mad just yet.

406
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:58,840
This might not be a bad thing.

407
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,120
As for Attorney Wang, recently,

408
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:02,360
she has been very motivated and hardworking.

409
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:03,480
Of course, as a newcomer,

410
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:06,940
it's inevitable for her to misjudge society and human nature.

411
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,360
But a real lesson

412
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,120
is often more effective than verbal preaching,

413
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:12,380
leaving a deeper and more direct impact.

414
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,760
So I believe in the future,

415
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,890
she won't make the same mistake again.

416
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,600
Never again.

417
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,760
Thank you, Mentor.

418
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:25,920
Thank you, Director.

419
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:27,240
You scared me to death.

420
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,600
Are you kidding me?

421
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,480
Ruoqi, welcome aboard officially.

422
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,300
Want some milk tea?

423
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,810
Jasmine green milk tea.

424
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:40,240
I'll have one too.

425
00:16:40,240 --> 00:16:41,900
Anything is fine, less sugar.

426
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,360
Me too.

427
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:18,720
I remember putting it here.

428
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:19,599
Look carefully again.

429
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:20,240
Mom, don't worry.

430
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,480
Check this inner pocket.

431
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,599
Is it in the inner pocket, Dad?

432
00:17:22,599 --> 00:17:23,119
I've checked everywhere.

433
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:24,319
Did you put it in yours?

434
00:17:24,319 --> 00:17:25,839
Could we have left it at home?

435
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:27,119
I really put it in.

436
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:28,840
Mom, this is bad.

437
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,360
Did you drop it on the way

438
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:32,120
when you were taking something out?

439
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:33,360
Don't worry.

440
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:35,960
Do you still remember the bank account number?

441
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:42,360
I'm sorry

442
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:43,760
for holding everyone up.

443
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:46,720
Can we use my wife's card instead?

444
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:48,000
I'm sorry.

445
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:50,250
The property owners are your parents.

446
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,360
The remaining balance from the house auction

447
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:55,020
can only be transferred to the owners' account.

448
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:58,000
So could one of you please go back and get it?

449
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:00,000
We can wait.

450
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:03,600
Then, Mom, I'll go back and look for it.

451
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:04,600
Don't worry.

452
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:05,130
Go ahead.

453
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,000
Look carefully.

454
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:09,600
Mr. Ma,

455
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:11,000
could you please

456
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:13,120
make a copy of your parents' ID cards?

457
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:14,640
You brought them, right?

458
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:15,360
Yes.

459
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:16,600
I have them here.

460
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:17,930
I'll go make the copies.

461
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:21,000
What an act.

462
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,360
Sir, ma'am.

463
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:29,620
After this money goes into your account,

464
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:31,040
you must keep it safe.

465
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:33,000
Don't make the same mistake again.

466
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:35,720
Otherwise, the money you worked hard to save all your life

467
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:38,440
might end up with your children, right?

468
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:41,440
We won't.

469
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,240
Sir, ma'am,

470
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:45,920
you must listen to Lawyer Li.

471
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:46,720
We will.

472
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,960
Don't give this money to anyone in the future.

473
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,280
Yes.

474
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:52,200
Children will have their own fortunes.

475
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,840
You can't help them forever.

476
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:55,000
Yes.

477
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,480
Why did you bump into me?

478
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:03,000
Why would I bump into you?

479
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:03,760
They were playing pool.

480
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:04,800
Why would I bump into you like that?

481
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:05,680
Why were you standing behind them?

482
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:07,000
You lost. I'm not playing anymore.

483
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:07,920
Don't cheat.

484
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:08,680
Why would I cheat?

485
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:09,960
Xiaolong, come here.

486
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:12,000
Your dad cheats even when playing pool.

487
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:12,560
Hurry up.

488
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:13,280
I won't play with her.

489
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:14,800
If you get help, I'll get help too.

490
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:16,000
Xin, come here.

491
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:16,480
Come.

492
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,420
You're just in time. Come.

493
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:21,000
Look at our Xiaolong's style.

494
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,000
I taught her.

495
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,260
Look at my godson, Xin.

496
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:27,000
Hurry up. You're the referee. Set up the balls.

497
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,760
It won't go in.

498
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:32,760
How's your case going?

499
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:34,820
Go ask that Su Qian'er from your team.

500
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:38,640
With him around, the case is delayed again.

501
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:41,240
The bank took the house back.

502
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:44,160
Now my client and her mom don't even have a home.

503
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,200
That's his job.

504
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:47,720
He's just doing his job.

505
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:50,000
It may just be a job to you,

506
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:52,200
but to my clients,

507
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:54,130
it's the first half of their lives.

508
00:19:55,040 --> 00:19:57,680
I feel sorry for what your clients went through,

509
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:58,680
but lawyers

510
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:01,800
have no obligation to bear moral responsibility.

511
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:04,240
The law is the baseline of morality.

512
00:20:04,520 --> 00:20:07,320
You can't hold yourself to the baseline every day.

513
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,520
The law also says

514
00:20:08,520 --> 00:20:09,480
you can't walk on the street naked.

515
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,720
Does that mean you wear briefs

516
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:11,520
on the street every day?

517
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:13,000
You're confusing the issue.

518
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:13,800
Anyway,

519
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:16,200
you better manage your team well,

520
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,480
especially that Su Qian'er.

521
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:20,480
Don't take every dirty case. It'll shorten your life.

522
00:20:20,560 --> 00:20:22,400
You better manage your team well too.

523
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,920
Your law firm is like a zoo.

524
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:27,000
He prints 'Senior Partner' on his business card.

525
00:20:27,040 --> 00:20:28,000
Does he have the qualifications?

526
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:30,400
Don't get your law firm's license revoked.

527
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:32,200
How did he get into your law firm?

528
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:33,530
Mind your own business.

529
00:20:34,280 --> 00:20:37,200
Anyway, I'll deal with Su Qian'er first.

530
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:39,530
After I'm done with him,

531
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,240
I'll deal with you.

532
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:46,130
Your Honor, I have new evidence to submit.

533
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:54,040
The transfer records between Fang Huilan and Wang Lijuan show

534
00:20:54,040 --> 00:20:55,400
that there were

535
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:57,240
continuous large loan records between the two parties,

536
00:20:57,240 --> 00:20:59,160
as well as a repayment record of 500,000.

537
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:01,240
The last loan of two million

538
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:04,440
was obtained by the appellee mortgaging her property,

539
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:05,480
and the IOU

540
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:07,280
clearly stipulated the loan interest.

541
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:09,040
Therefore, there is reason to suspect

542
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:10,800
that Fang Huilan is a professional moneylender,

543
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:12,720
constituting the crime of illegal business operations.

544
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:13,560
We believe

545
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:15,160
that a lawful judgment must never

546
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,440
protect such illegal interests.

547
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:17,560
You're talking nonsense, you little side-part.

548
00:21:17,560 --> 00:21:19,040
You have no conscience saying that, you know?

549
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:20,770
Observers, please keep quiet.

550
00:21:23,280 --> 00:21:24,000
My statements

551
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,000
are all supported by the evidence

552
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:26,960
you provided in the first instance.

553
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,440
Your statements will not affect

554
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:31,040
the focus of the dispute and the trial result of this case.

555
00:21:31,040 --> 00:21:33,000
It's entirely an excuse to delay the judicial process

556
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:35,460
and help Wang Lijuan avoid paying her debts.

557
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:39,290
Your Honor, I apply to submit supplementary evidence in court.

558
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,440
What happened to the old lady?

559
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:58,160
Yeah,

560
00:21:58,160 --> 00:21:59,720
it's all ruined like this.

561
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,280
It's really hard to watch.

562
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:08,160
The footage shows the tragic situation caused by Wang Lijuan's failure to repay her debt,

563
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:09,560
forcing Fang Huilan and her mother,

564
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:11,400
after the bank loan expired,

565
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:13,520
to move out of their old house.

566
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:15,000
What's more unfortunate is that

567
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:17,280
not long ago, Fang Huilan's mother,

568
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:19,240
due to this series of blows,

569
00:22:19,560 --> 00:22:21,040
suffered a worsening condition,

570
00:22:21,040 --> 00:22:22,480
and had to stay in a nursing home,

571
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:24,440
living a displaced life.

572
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:27,760
And Fang Huilan herself, due to poor health,

573
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:30,040
is unable to appear in court today.

574
00:22:30,040 --> 00:22:31,100
I would like to ask,

575
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:35,660
who has ever seen a professional moneylender end up like this?

576
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:37,000
Your Honor,

577
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:39,200
I think the evidence provided by the opposing counsel

578
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,240
and whether Fang Huilan is a professional moneylender

579
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,160
have no causal link.

580
00:22:42,160 --> 00:22:42,920
Your Honor,

581
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:45,160
in the written evidence I just provided,

582
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:46,560
Fang Huilan's retirement certificate,

583
00:22:46,560 --> 00:22:49,560
monthly fixed pension payment records, etc.,

584
00:22:49,560 --> 00:22:50,400
can all prove

585
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:52,520
that she has a legal source of income,

586
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:54,040
and that in her bank account,

587
00:22:54,040 --> 00:22:56,000
there is no lending profit income,

588
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,240
which is enough to prove

589
00:22:57,240 --> 00:23:00,200
that Fang Huilan herself is not a professional moneylender.

590
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:01,560
And the footage just shown

591
00:23:01,560 --> 00:23:04,160
further proves that the other party's failure to repay the debt

592
00:23:04,160 --> 00:23:06,760
has caused serious consequences to my client.

593
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:09,160
Is this the ending a kind, honest,

594
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:11,040
and innocent person deserves?

595
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:15,000
Appellant, do you have anything new to add?

596
00:23:16,440 --> 00:23:17,200
No.

597
00:23:17,200 --> 00:23:18,000
I do.

598
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:20,440
I hope everyone

599
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,560
can firmly remember

600
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:24,240
the footage just now,

601
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:27,000
showing Fang Huilan's family living on the streets.

602
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:28,440
Think carefully about it.

603
00:23:28,440 --> 00:23:29,280
A good person,

604
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:31,480
why would she end up like this today?

605
00:23:32,160 --> 00:23:33,760
Is it because she is too kind?

606
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:37,800
I believe the law should protect kind people.

607
00:23:38,400 --> 00:23:40,720
If morality cannot restrain people's hearts,

608
00:23:40,720 --> 00:23:42,380
then the law should be allowed

609
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:45,170
to become the last line of defense.

610
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:46,480
Well said.

611
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:50,000
That's so intense.

612
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:51,520
All rise.

613
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:56,400
The facts found in the trial are clear,

614
00:23:56,520 --> 00:23:57,960
and the application of the law is correct.

615
00:23:57,960 --> 00:23:59,280
The judgment of this court is

616
00:23:59,280 --> 00:24:02,340
to dismiss the appeal and uphold the original verdict.

617
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:25,340
Are you looking for Grandma Fang?

618
00:24:25,560 --> 00:24:26,960
She had a sudden heart attack this morning

619
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:28,820
and was sent to a nearby hospital.

620
00:24:46,520 --> 00:24:47,280
Aunt Fang.

621
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:49,240
The verdict is out.

622
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:51,000
We won.

623
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:01,800
Lawyer Xiao.

624
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:04,240
Thank you.

625
00:25:04,560 --> 00:25:05,520
It's my duty. You're welcome.

626
00:25:05,520 --> 00:25:06,720
Thank you all.

627
00:25:11,520 --> 00:25:12,240
Doctor.

628
00:25:15,240 --> 00:25:16,000
I'm sorry.

629
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,560
We did our best.

630
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:38,400
Aunt Fang, Aunt Fang.

631
00:25:58,320 --> 00:25:59,280
Aunt Fang.

632
00:26:00,280 --> 00:26:01,210
My condolences.

633
00:26:04,280 --> 00:26:05,360
My mom,

634
00:26:06,520 --> 00:26:09,000
she wouldn't have died so early.

635
00:26:11,080 --> 00:26:12,840
It's all because of me.

636
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:19,080
I just wanted to help people.

637
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:25,760
Why did it end up like this?

638
00:26:37,360 --> 00:26:39,160
This world is too unfair.

639
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:07,080
Who hasn't trusted the wrong person in their life?

640
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:13,080
Please take good care of this case.

641
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:36,920
Zhang Guang.

642
00:27:38,560 --> 00:27:41,080
I received the invitation you sent me.

643
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:43,160
Well, the thing is...

644
00:27:43,160 --> 00:27:45,760
I have to go out of town for a trial this weekend.

645
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:47,720
Right, I won't be going.

646
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:49,160
Yeah. Okay, okay.

647
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:53,640
Come in.

648
00:27:53,760 --> 00:27:54,490
Attorney Li.

649
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:56,520
The case file is ready.

650
00:27:59,080 --> 00:28:00,920
You don't even try when you lie.

651
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:02,450
Who has a trial on a weekend?

652
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:05,000
My classmate Zhang Guang.

653
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:05,760
He got engaged.

654
00:28:05,760 --> 00:28:06,760
I don't want to go.

655
00:28:08,280 --> 00:28:09,740
The one who owes you money?

656
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:13,960
He really handled that poorly.

657
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:16,200
I figured I'd just cut contact with him.

658
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:20,540
Send me a copy of that invitation.

659
00:28:36,760 --> 00:28:37,640
Today

660
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:40,640
is the engagement day of our Zhang Guang and Xiaona.

661
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:43,680
From now on, our two families are one.

662
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:45,800
Xiaona is like my own daughter.

663
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:48,920
Come, let me toast everyone.

664
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:49,560
Come.

665
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:53,920
So happy.

666
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:56,640
Stop for a moment.

667
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:59,920
I am a judge from the Enforcement Bureau of Anping District People's Court.

668
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:01,720
Who are Wang Lijuan and Zhang Guang?

669
00:29:01,720 --> 00:29:03,400
Well, it's a joyous day.

670
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:04,800
And the judge is here too.

671
00:29:04,840 --> 00:29:06,080
Let's go outside to talk if there's anything.

672
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:06,760
No need.

673
00:29:07,280 --> 00:29:09,610
Are these two properties under your name?

674
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:10,780
It's fine, Auntie.

675
00:29:11,320 --> 00:29:12,640
What happened?

676
00:29:12,720 --> 00:29:15,400
Girl, let me tell you what happened.

677
00:29:15,640 --> 00:29:17,960
Your future mother-in-law and your future husband

678
00:29:17,960 --> 00:29:20,160
owe my client three million.

679
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:21,640
Three million.

680
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:24,160
And they refuse to pay it back.

681
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:25,520
What nonsense are you talking about?

682
00:29:25,520 --> 00:29:26,920
What do you mean refuse to pay?

683
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:27,720
In-laws, this...

684
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:29,400
Don't listen to their nonsense.

685
00:29:29,400 --> 00:29:31,000
Judge, it's like this.

686
00:29:31,320 --> 00:29:33,760
I rented out those two houses.

687
00:29:33,760 --> 00:29:35,160
I signed a 20-year contract.

688
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:36,760
The rent has long been spent.

689
00:29:36,760 --> 00:29:38,440
According to the regulations,

690
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:40,240
doesn't the sale not break the lease?

691
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,700
Yes, it's hard to sell now.

692
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:44,160
They have already done property preservation.

693
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:44,920
That is to say,

694
00:29:44,920 --> 00:29:47,080
the time you supposedly signed the lease

695
00:29:47,080 --> 00:29:48,720
was after the property preservation.

696
00:29:48,720 --> 00:29:50,520
This is malicious debt evasion.

697
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:51,960
What is property preservation?

698
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:53,020
Don't understand?

699
00:29:53,320 --> 00:29:54,760
I'll explain it to you.

700
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:56,800
Aunt Fang, when Wang Lijuan receives the subpoena,

701
00:29:56,800 --> 00:29:58,680
she will definitely try every means not to pay.

702
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:00,400
If we do property preservation,

703
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:02,930
the court will temporarily freeze her assets

704
00:30:03,040 --> 00:30:04,480
to prevent her from transferring them.

705
00:30:04,480 --> 00:30:06,810
You haven't seen this document, have you?

706
00:30:08,160 --> 00:30:10,920
This ruling is different from a subpoena.

707
00:30:11,040 --> 00:30:13,280
It has legal effect whether it's served or not.

708
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:15,160
We have already applied for enforcement.

709
00:30:15,160 --> 00:30:16,520
You can't be a deadbeat anymore.

710
00:30:16,520 --> 00:30:17,280
What is this called?

711
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:18,280
This is called lifting a rock,

712
00:30:18,280 --> 00:30:19,880
only to drop it on your own feet.

713
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:20,400
What nonsense are you talking about?

714
00:30:20,400 --> 00:30:22,080
Your family even tricked me into believing

715
00:30:22,080 --> 00:30:24,000
that you can withdraw housing funds for rent.

716
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:26,200
Turns out you were doing this wicked thing all along.

717
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:28,080
The wedding is off.

718
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:28,880
No, Auntie.

719
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:30,010
Auntie, I was wrong.

720
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:31,800
Nana, please talk to her.

721
00:30:32,080 --> 00:30:33,280
Xiaona, Xiaona, Xiaona.

722
00:30:33,280 --> 00:30:34,160
It was all my mom's idea.

723
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:34,890
Wang Lijuan,

724
00:30:35,040 --> 00:30:35,640
Zhang Guang,

725
00:30:35,640 --> 00:30:38,800
because you refused to comply with the court's effective judgment,

726
00:30:38,800 --> 00:30:40,440
attempted to obstruct the judicial auction,

727
00:30:40,440 --> 00:30:41,200
and showed a bad attitude,

728
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:42,160
this court has decided

729
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:43,000
to impose on you

730
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:45,400
a penalty of 15 days of judicial detention.

731
00:30:45,560 --> 00:30:46,320
Oh my god.

732
00:30:46,320 --> 00:30:47,320
What a good judge.

733
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:49,400
You really are a great and just official.

734
00:30:49,400 --> 00:30:49,860
Well...

735
00:30:50,000 --> 00:30:50,680
Um...

736
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:52,800
Can we just not rent the house?

737
00:30:54,640 --> 00:30:56,300
What are you doing? Step back.

738
00:30:56,320 --> 00:30:58,240
Do you know what obstructing law enforcement is?

739
00:30:58,240 --> 00:30:59,200
Who is that?

740
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:05,460
It's fine, Auntie.

741
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:07,700
Just let me know if you need anything.

742
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:09,800
I'm running a law firm now.

743
00:31:09,800 --> 00:31:12,130
I just won a case worth over three million.

744
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:16,020
Handling your family's little issue is a piece of cake.

745
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:19,560
Aunt Fang.

746
00:31:21,280 --> 00:31:23,000
I made a cross-stitch.

747
00:31:23,760 --> 00:31:25,000
It's just a small token of my appreciation.

748
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:26,400
This thing is really hard on the eyes.

749
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:27,040
Yeah.

750
00:31:27,040 --> 00:31:28,080
Thank you, Aunt Fang.

751
00:31:28,080 --> 00:31:30,160
Dragon, Tiger, Good, Inscribe, Flying, Tiger.

752
00:31:30,160 --> 00:31:31,080
No.

753
00:31:31,720 --> 00:31:34,560
Dragons flying and phoenixes rising, Tigers roaring with power.

754
00:31:34,560 --> 00:31:38,160
Good Seedlings embracing the new, Inscribing merits in bronze.

755
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:39,160
It's read vertically.

756
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:41,620
Aunt Fang embroidered all our names into it.

757
00:31:42,000 --> 00:31:43,520
Thank you, Aunt Fang.

758
00:31:43,520 --> 00:31:44,320
And here.

759
00:31:45,720 --> 00:31:46,920
This is the legal fee.

760
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:50,760
And this is the money Lawyer Xiao advanced for me.

761
00:31:51,520 --> 00:31:52,880
It's 350,000 in total.

762
00:31:53,560 --> 00:31:55,320
Don't think I'm old-fashioned.

763
00:31:55,320 --> 00:31:58,760
We old people always feel more secure with cash.

764
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:00,200
Not only is it secure,

765
00:32:00,560 --> 00:32:01,680
it's also solid.

766
00:32:02,960 --> 00:32:03,560
Miaomiao,

767
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:05,260
get the money counter.

768
00:32:11,640 --> 00:32:13,800
Aunt Fang, this 50,000

769
00:32:13,800 --> 00:32:15,260
is what I advanced for you,

770
00:32:15,920 --> 00:32:18,520
for the litigation fee, property preservation fee,

771
00:32:18,520 --> 00:32:19,920
and the nursing home fee.

772
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:21,730
As for the rest of the money,

773
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:23,760
I'll take 100,000 from you,

774
00:32:23,760 --> 00:32:26,360
and we'll just count it as the normal legal fee.

775
00:32:26,560 --> 00:32:29,200
Girl, what are you doing?

776
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:33,640
What you've done for me can't be repaid with money.

777
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:36,560
Besides, this money was agreed upon long ago.

778
00:32:36,560 --> 00:32:38,280
Yeah, wasn't it agreed upon before?

779
00:32:38,280 --> 00:32:39,520
You're not showing Auntie any respect, are you?

780
00:32:39,520 --> 00:32:41,050
You're looking down on her.

781
00:32:42,800 --> 00:32:45,280
Aunt Fang, I'm no saint.

782
00:32:45,280 --> 00:32:46,520
I like money too.

783
00:32:46,880 --> 00:32:48,040
I have no grudge against money.

784
00:32:48,040 --> 00:32:49,800
But after finishing this case,

785
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,860
seeing what you've been through,

786
00:32:51,920 --> 00:32:54,780
if I put hundreds of thousands of yours in my pocket,

787
00:32:55,280 --> 00:32:58,160
I really wouldn't feel at ease spending it.

788
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:19,800
Aunt Fang, I've accepted your legal fee,

789
00:33:20,320 --> 00:33:22,080
and I've accepted your gift.

790
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:25,160
From today on,

791
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:27,080
I hope you can

792
00:33:27,640 --> 00:33:29,920
start over and live a good life.

793
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:04,490
Your performance bonus

794
00:34:04,800 --> 00:34:07,320
will still be 20% of the contingency fee.

795
00:34:09,880 --> 00:34:11,800
Then I'll take it.

796
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:12,639
Take it.

797
00:34:14,080 --> 00:34:14,920
You...

798
00:34:17,679 --> 00:34:19,440
Doesn't this make it a 40-60 split?

799
00:34:19,440 --> 00:34:20,480
And I get the 60.

800
00:34:20,480 --> 00:34:21,800
All right, you're slick enough.

801
00:34:21,800 --> 00:34:22,920
Cut the act.

802
00:34:22,920 --> 00:34:23,800
Come on, just take it.

803
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:26,159
I didn't discuss this with you,

804
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:28,210
so you shouldn't bear the risk.

805
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:29,920
Well, before I was...

806
00:34:30,520 --> 00:34:32,040
Since we're not sharing it, fine.

807
00:34:32,040 --> 00:34:32,880
Thanks.

808
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:41,500
Put the money away.

809
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:45,159
What?

810
00:34:45,480 --> 00:34:48,400
I have to say, you handled this generously.

811
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:50,400
You're so generous that I feel a bit guilty.

812
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:51,960
Since you're being so generous,

813
00:34:51,960 --> 00:34:53,480
as a man,

814
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:55,280
I can't be too stingy either.

815
00:35:05,680 --> 00:35:07,610
Twenty percent is twenty percent.

816
00:35:08,160 --> 00:35:08,920
Dong Beihu,

817
00:35:09,280 --> 00:35:10,880
don't be impulsive

818
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:12,160
and refund me the money.

819
00:35:12,160 --> 00:35:13,640
When you want shares or money later,

820
00:35:13,640 --> 00:35:14,800
you'll have nothing.

821
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:15,800
Don't worry.

822
00:35:16,680 --> 00:35:17,800
A hero has no regrets.

823
00:35:17,800 --> 00:35:19,680
Yeah, Sister Long. Since Brother Hu is so generous,

824
00:35:19,680 --> 00:35:21,160
just keep the money.

825
00:35:21,240 --> 00:35:22,040
So cool.

826
00:35:22,040 --> 00:35:23,160
Put it away quickly.

827
00:35:23,160 --> 00:35:24,800
Close the door. Don't let me see it.

828
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:26,920
If you're so reluctant, take it back.

829
00:35:26,920 --> 00:35:27,850
No need. No need.

830
00:35:28,400 --> 00:35:28,920
Well,

831
00:35:28,920 --> 00:35:31,050
have I passed my probation period now?

832
00:35:31,200 --> 00:35:31,800
Yes.

833
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:33,160
But from now on, if anything happens,

834
00:35:33,160 --> 00:35:34,360
you must sync with me.

835
00:35:34,640 --> 00:35:36,840
Huzi, come down.

836
00:35:38,320 --> 00:35:39,450
Let me sync with you.

837
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:40,730
My mom is calling me.

838
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:42,480
I... I heard it too.

839
00:35:44,840 --> 00:35:45,770
Welcome aboard.

840
00:35:54,560 --> 00:35:55,960
Why did he actually come?

841
00:35:56,080 --> 00:35:58,760
Weren't you the one bragging in the group?

842
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:02,160
"Come to me if you have difficulties you can't solve."

843
00:36:02,160 --> 00:36:03,360
Didn't you say that yourself?

844
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:05,680
I meant difficulties like lawsuits.

845
00:36:05,680 --> 00:36:07,400
You can come to me if you want to sue someone.

846
00:36:07,400 --> 00:36:09,000
Why come to me for a job?

847
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:09,960
Am I an agency?

848
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:12,840
Introducing a top student to the law firm

849
00:36:12,840 --> 00:36:14,280
is a great thing.

850
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:15,400
What top student?

851
00:36:15,400 --> 00:36:16,080
How top?

852
00:36:16,080 --> 00:36:17,960
Stop it. Hurry up and pick him up.

853
00:36:17,960 --> 00:36:19,560
He's already at the station.

854
00:36:20,320 --> 00:36:20,960
I...

855
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,440
Are you Luo Zhi?

856
00:36:38,920 --> 00:36:39,520
Uncle.

857
00:36:43,080 --> 00:36:43,680
Uncle.

858
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:47,540
What are you doing?

859
00:36:47,920 --> 00:36:49,320
Uncle, I'm Luo Zhi.

860
00:36:49,920 --> 00:36:50,400
You...

861
00:36:50,520 --> 00:36:51,560
Are you Luo Zhi?

862
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:53,560
What did you call me?

863
00:36:53,560 --> 00:36:54,480
Uncle.

864
00:36:55,080 --> 00:36:55,920
Look at us.

865
00:36:55,920 --> 00:36:57,450
Who should call whom uncle?

866
00:36:57,800 --> 00:36:58,760
I've calculated it.

867
00:36:58,760 --> 00:37:00,960
According to seniority, I should call you uncle.

868
00:37:00,960 --> 00:37:03,880
Are you that top law student?

869
00:37:04,080 --> 00:37:04,520
Yes.

870
00:37:04,800 --> 00:37:05,440
Bachelor of Law.

871
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:07,560
Uncle, I brought you some local specialties.

872
00:37:07,560 --> 00:37:08,400
Hometown specialties.

873
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,960
Mushrooms. They're delicious in chicken stew.

874
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:10,920
Okay, thank you.

875
00:37:11,080 --> 00:37:12,920
Uncle also brought you a gift.

876
00:37:12,920 --> 00:37:13,840
Here, dumplings.

877
00:37:13,840 --> 00:37:14,700
Are you hungry?

878
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:16,480
That's not right.

879
00:37:16,760 --> 00:37:17,840
According to our hometown custom,

880
00:37:17,840 --> 00:37:19,520
shouldn't it be dumplings for leaving and noodles for arriving?

881
00:37:19,520 --> 00:37:20,720
Shouldn't we eat noodles?

882
00:37:20,720 --> 00:37:22,520
Right. A top student gets it immediately.

883
00:37:22,520 --> 00:37:23,360
Eat them on the train.

884
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:25,290
Uncle will buy you a ticket online.

885
00:37:25,360 --> 00:37:25,880
Go.

886
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:29,380
No, I haven't been to the law firm yet.

887
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:31,880
My law firm just opened.

888
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:33,080
I don't need anyone right now.

889
00:37:33,080 --> 00:37:33,480
Okay?

890
00:37:33,480 --> 00:37:34,400
Go back and wait for news.

891
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:34,840
Go, go.

892
00:37:34,840 --> 00:37:36,080
It's fine. I'll just follow you.

893
00:37:36,080 --> 00:37:38,400
I'll just learn whatever I can.

894
00:37:39,080 --> 00:37:40,400
Let me tell you this.

895
00:37:40,400 --> 00:37:41,440
As for my law firm,

896
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,800
I'm not the only one in charge now.

897
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,000
I also have a partner,

898
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:45,080
a cooperating lawyer.

899
00:37:45,080 --> 00:37:46,760
You can't get in without her approval.

900
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:48,760
Otherwise, wouldn't I be abusing my power? Right?

901
00:37:48,760 --> 00:37:49,920
You have to understand your uncle.

902
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:51,320
Go back now. Be good.

903
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,120
I'm going, I'm going.

904
00:37:52,120 --> 00:37:52,480
Then,

905
00:37:52,560 --> 00:37:53,320
Uncle, uncle.

906
00:37:53,320 --> 00:37:54,320
I understand that.

907
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:55,050
We can just do

908
00:37:55,480 --> 00:37:56,610
a formal interview.

909
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:57,840
Don't worry.

910
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:59,240
I have a lot of strengths.

911
00:37:59,560 --> 00:38:00,690
I have a good memory,

912
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:02,080
and great perseverance.

913
00:38:02,080 --> 00:38:03,520
And I'm never afraid of failure.

914
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:05,480
Look, I've failed the bar exam for five years,

915
00:38:05,480 --> 00:38:05,920
but next year...

916
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:07,000
Wait a minute.

917
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:09,080
You haven't even passed the bar exam?

918
00:38:09,080 --> 00:38:10,520
But I must try again next year.

919
00:38:10,520 --> 00:38:11,680
Don't try again. Just stop.

920
00:38:11,680 --> 00:38:13,000
I'll send you a red envelope later.

921
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,680
Then you can buy whatever you want to eat.

922
00:38:14,680 --> 00:38:15,480
I'm not leaving.

923
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:16,800
Just go, just go.

924
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:17,080
Just go.

925
00:38:17,080 --> 00:38:17,940
Later, I'll...

926
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:18,800
Hurry.

927
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:20,840
Go, go, go.

928
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:21,780
Hurry up and go.

929
00:38:22,200 --> 00:38:22,760
Go back.

930
00:38:23,400 --> 00:38:26,130
Don't look back. If you do, I'll beat you to death.

931
00:38:28,480 --> 00:38:29,800
What the hell?

932
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:38,200
I didn't put up banners or make a scene.

933
00:38:38,520 --> 00:38:40,480
I'm just here to vent my grievances to everyone.

934
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:41,480
Did I break the law?

935
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:42,280
Mr. Han.

936
00:38:42,600 --> 00:38:44,560
Look, making such a scene at our company's entrance

937
00:38:44,560 --> 00:38:46,360
really affects our reputation.

938
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:48,280
You think you're in the right, don't you?

939
00:38:48,280 --> 00:38:49,520
When I bought the insurance back then,

940
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:50,960
you didn't say anything.

941
00:38:51,360 --> 00:38:52,400
Now that it's time to settle the claim,

942
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:54,280
there are all these conditions.

943
00:38:54,400 --> 00:38:56,520
What reputation does a company like yours have?

944
00:38:56,520 --> 00:38:57,880
Tell your boss

945
00:38:57,880 --> 00:39:00,000
that this is the last time I'm coming here.

946
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:01,660
Tell him I'll see him in court.

947
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:02,400
No, no.

948
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:03,320
Mr. Han.

949
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:11,400
Although I haven't passed the bar exam yet,

950
00:39:11,400 --> 00:39:13,360
I promise I'll get the certificate this year.

951
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:14,690
Please give me a chance.

952
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:16,320
Where did you pop up from?

953
00:39:16,560 --> 00:39:18,160
Didn't I put you on the train?

954
00:39:18,280 --> 00:39:19,800
Uncle, I didn't get on the train.

955
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:21,000
I refunded the ticket

956
00:39:21,200 --> 00:39:23,400
and used the money to hitch a ride back.

957
00:39:23,680 --> 00:39:24,610
Awesome, right?

958
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:27,000
No, I... what I said to you,

959
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:28,860
you didn't take it to heart at all.

960
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:30,960
It has nothing to do with me.

961
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:32,620
He... I didn't ask him to come.

962
00:39:32,640 --> 00:39:33,480
He...

963
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:35,840
Luo... Luo Zhi.

964
00:39:35,960 --> 00:39:36,160
Luo Zhi.

965
00:39:36,160 --> 00:39:36,360
Luo Zhi.

966
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:38,840
Luo Zhi said it has nothing to do with you.

967
00:39:39,400 --> 00:39:40,440
But Luo Zhi,

968
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:41,840
your uncle is right.

969
00:39:42,200 --> 00:39:44,520
My law firm really doesn't need anyone right now.

970
00:39:44,520 --> 00:39:46,800
Hear that? Would your uncle lie to you?

971
00:39:47,160 --> 00:39:48,880
Uncle, Lawyer Xiao,

972
00:39:49,200 --> 00:39:51,440
I don't want money, and I won't take up space.

973
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:53,000
Just give me a chance to learn.

974
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:54,480
What chance?

975
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:55,840
The chance to sneak back,

976
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:56,520
I shouldn't have given it to you.

977
00:39:56,520 --> 00:39:57,160
Just go.

978
00:39:57,160 --> 00:39:58,840
Won't take up space? You're as big as two of me.

979
00:39:58,840 --> 00:40:00,480
Let me say a few more words to Lawyer Xiao.

980
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:02,080
What else is there to say? This is quite expensive.

981
00:40:02,080 --> 00:40:02,760
Lawyer Xiao.

982
00:40:02,760 --> 00:40:04,160
I have a very meticulous mind.

983
00:40:04,160 --> 00:40:05,400
I'm suited for law.

984
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:05,960
Hurry, go.

985
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:06,960
I'll memorize it.

986
00:40:07,160 --> 00:40:08,360
I have a good memory.

987
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:09,890
Hurry up and go be a cashier.

988
00:40:12,480 --> 00:40:13,560
Look at you, kid.

989
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:15,480
Why are you working?

990
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:17,480
It's fine, Great-aunt.

991
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:19,210
I figured I should do what I can.

992
00:40:19,280 --> 00:40:21,080
I can't just live here for free.

993
00:40:22,480 --> 00:40:23,760
What a good boy.

994
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:25,160
I'm just anxious

995
00:40:25,160 --> 00:40:27,320
and can't help you with anything.

996
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:30,610
It's fine, Great-aunt. I want to stay at the law firm too,

997
00:40:30,880 --> 00:40:32,320
but my uncle is right.

998
00:40:32,480 --> 00:40:34,740
We can't use our power for personal gain.

999
00:40:34,800 --> 00:40:36,520
I'll just earn it myself.

1000
00:40:36,560 --> 00:40:39,520
Then how do you plan to earn it?

1001
00:40:50,520 --> 00:40:51,760
Good morning, Director.

1002
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:52,290
Morning.

1003
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:54,340
What are you doing?

1004
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:56,520
I'm fine. I saw the entrance was a bit dirty.

1005
00:40:56,520 --> 00:40:59,520
So I just cleaned it up a bit on my way.

1006
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:01,040
Thank you.

1007
00:41:01,040 --> 00:41:02,900
No problem. Good morning, Uncle.

1008
00:41:03,080 --> 00:41:03,920
Working hard?

1009
00:41:06,880 --> 00:41:09,010
Are you showing off your talents here?

1010
00:41:09,520 --> 00:41:11,040
Did you mop the floor with soap?

1011
00:41:11,040 --> 00:41:12,520
I almost pulled a muscle.

1012
00:41:13,520 --> 00:41:14,280
Alright.

1013
00:41:14,760 --> 00:41:16,880
I ran into a case on the road yesterday.

1014
00:41:16,880 --> 00:41:18,040
He wants to sue an insurance company.

1015
00:41:18,040 --> 00:41:19,480
I've never handled an insurance case before.

1016
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:21,040
It's a good opportunity to expand your business.

1017
00:41:21,040 --> 00:41:22,560
The amount is quite large. He'll be here soon.

1018
00:41:22,560 --> 00:41:25,000
Regardless of the amount, I have to be responsible to the client.

1019
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:25,860
Are you respo--

1020
00:41:28,040 --> 00:41:28,880
Mr. Han.

1021
00:41:29,120 --> 00:41:30,000
You've arrived?

1022
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:31,280
Okay, okay. I'll come pick you up.

1023
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:31,840
Okay.

1024
00:41:32,480 --> 00:41:33,680
He's here. Get ready.

1025
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:36,920
What's going on?

1026
00:41:36,920 --> 00:41:38,250
You'll know in a minute.

1027
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:50,480
Mr. Wei.

1028
00:41:50,880 --> 00:41:51,560
Hello, Attorney Li.

1029
00:41:51,560 --> 00:41:54,080
This is Xiao Longnü, a lawyer from our firm.

1030
00:41:54,520 --> 00:41:55,480
Hello.

1031
00:41:55,920 --> 00:41:56,800
Hello.

1032
00:41:58,520 --> 00:41:59,520
Here's the thing.

1033
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:03,480
Four years ago, right after our Xinxin was born,

1034
00:42:04,040 --> 00:42:05,880
we went to Shengkang Insurance

1035
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:08,320
and bought her that critical illness insurance.

1036
00:42:08,320 --> 00:42:09,040
And then...

1037
00:42:10,320 --> 00:42:12,480
Last month, the child suddenly...

1038
00:42:14,320 --> 00:42:15,780
It's okay. Take your time.

1039
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:19,700
What's the insurance company's reason for the rejection?

1040
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:20,960
They don't meet

1041
00:42:20,960 --> 00:42:24,040
the claim conditions of the critical illness insurance contract.

1042
00:42:24,040 --> 00:42:25,920
We explained it to the child's parents,

1043
00:42:25,920 --> 00:42:27,640
but they wouldn't listen at all.

1044
00:42:27,640 --> 00:42:29,160
Several departments of the insurance company

1045
00:42:29,160 --> 00:42:30,600
keep passing the buck

1046
00:42:30,600 --> 00:42:32,000
back and forth,

1047
00:42:32,000 --> 00:42:33,480
and just won't solve it for us.

1048
00:42:33,480 --> 00:42:35,000
And they said we were just making a scene.

1049
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:37,530
I personally sympathize with them very much.

1050
00:42:37,800 --> 00:42:40,480
But the company must strictly follow the contract.

1051
00:42:40,480 --> 00:42:42,160
We can't pay compensation just because they are miserable.

1052
00:42:42,160 --> 00:42:44,080
We really have no other choice.

1053
00:42:44,440 --> 00:42:45,300
Attorney Xiao.

1054
00:42:45,840 --> 00:42:47,400
I beg you to help us.

1055
00:42:47,560 --> 00:42:49,400
Attorney Li, please.
